{{Unobtainable}}
'''Norn''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 113
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Norn
|name2 = Norn CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Norn CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Norn is an easily outclassed unit. Thanks to his poor stats, range, and his Single Target, it's much better to use [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] or alternatively, [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]]. In {{4c}} stages, it is recommended to use [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Dread Pirate Catley]] or [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Enchantress Cat]] instead, as both are superior in almost every way, from health and uptime to range and spammability.

